OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,6,     Gperformances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond including a live concert
OL,8,     Gbroadcast from Media City UK in
OL,9,     GSalford by the BBC Philharmonic
OL,10,     GOrchestra.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GFrom St Michael's Church, Barnes,
OL,13,     GLondon, with the choir of Tiffin
OL,14,     GSchool and music by Oliver Tarney
OL,15,     Gand Howells.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,18,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,19,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,20,     GToday, antagonising censors, two
OL,21,     Gtragic losses and the writing of
OL,22,     Ghis most iconic scene.
